# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Publish artifacts — the client pins funko_catalog_master.json.gz by SHA-256 in
# manifest.json, so ANY byte-level rewrite on checkout breaks every device: the
# download fails its checksum, is discarded, and the refresh backs off forever.
# Git currently leaves the gzip alone because it sniffs it as binary. Do not rely
# on sniffing for a file whose bytes are pinned.
*.gz                      binary
funko_catalog_master.json -text
manifest.json             -text

# Other binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
